@startuml
title US-004 - Register resource - SSD level 1
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Admin or Staff" as Staff
participant "Nexo" as System

Staff -> System: Register resource (name, type, optional description)
activate System
alt Caller cannot manage resources
    System --> Staff: Authorization error; nothing created
else Invalid details or type not available to the organization
    System --> Staff: Validation errors; nothing created
else Plan resource limit reached
    System --> Staff: Limit-reached error; nothing created
else Request accepted
    System --> Staff: Resource created as Available
end
deactivate System
@enduml
